      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can help you draft a formal service request email. Here's a possible version:\n\nSubject: Urgent Electrical System Issue at [Cafe Name] in Berlin\n\nDear [Contractor's Name],\n\nI am writing to bring to your attention a pressing electrical issue at our cafe, [Cafe Name], located in Berlin. Over the past week, we have been experiencing erratic behavior from our electrical system, which is causing significant disruptions to our operations.\n\nThe lights in the corner booth have been flickering at random intervals, and the espresso machine has been experiencing intermittent power losses, even when there are no visible connections to the electrical grid. This unpredictability is not only frustrating but also raises concerns about potential safety risks.\n\nI am concerned that there may be an underlying issue, such as a fault in the wiring or a nearby source of electromagnetic interference, that is causing these problems. I would like to request your immediate assistance in sending a technician to our location for a thorough inspection of the circuit.\n\nThe situation is becoming increasingly stressful, and I would appreciate it if you could arrange for a prompt visit to resolve this issue. Please let me know your availability, and I will schedule a time that suits you.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter.",
